# Agent Orchestration

The current Cursor main Agent is the QuantaHub Master/Orchestrator. Do not create an extra orchestration subagent layer by default.

Specialist subagents:
- quanta-platform
- quanta-lab-engine
- quanta-security
- quanta-frontend
- quanta-verifier

Rules:
- The user normally gives work to the main Agent; it decomposes and delegates.
- Delegate by ownership boundary, not arbitrary file count.
- Use specialist agents proactively when their description matches the work.
- Parallelize only independent tasks and avoid concurrent edits to the same ownership area.
- Security-sensitive work must be reviewed by quanta-security.
- No meaningful implementation is complete until quanta-verifier supplies appropriate evidence.
- Repository rules/docs are canonical memory; chat history is not.
